#
# An RDF 1.2 fixture whose reification layer puts a TRIPLE TERM within reach of
# an ordinary triple pattern: `:r1 rdf:reifies <<( :a :knows :b )>>`. A template
# that carries that binding into subject position is asking for an asserted
# statement about a quoted triple, which the RDF 1.2 term model does not admit —
# so the instantiation is ill-formed and §16.2 skips it.
#
# The reifier is an IRI, not a blank node, so the expectations name it directly.
@prefix : <http://example.org/> .

:a :knows :b ~:r1 {| :certainty "0.9" |} .
